  "美国半导体硬件 / 费城半导体 · 谨慎 / 泡沫如期出清，短线试探交易性机会": "US semiconductor hardware / Philadelphia Semiconductor Index · Caution / bubble bursts as expected; tactical testing of short-term opportunities",
