  "密切跟踪11月底美军双航母战斗群就位动向与霍尔木兹海峡局势，在95-110美元宽幅震荡区间保留多头敞口，防范地缘升级尾部风险。": "Closely track the late-November arrival of dual US carrier strike groups and Hormuz Strait conditions, retaining long exposure within the wide $95–110 trading range to hedge tail-risk escalations.",
  "美军罗斯福号航母群与马金岛号两栖群正驶向中东（增兵至少9000人使总数逾5万），大选后打击窗口打开；油价面临三路径：临时协议海峡开放回落至80美元、有限打击维持95-110美元震荡、或地面升级夺取哈尔克岛；鉴于美战略石油储备降至1982年以来最低水平且缓冲薄弱，一旦升级油价或突破年内高点。": "The USS Roosevelt CSG and USS Makin Island ARG are heading to the Middle East (+9,000 troops, bringing regional total over 50,000), opening a post-election strike window; oil faces three scenarios: temporary truce reopening the strait ($80), limited strikes ($95–110), or ground escalation taking Kharg Island; with US SPR at its lowest since 1982, thin buffers mean any escalation could break prior yearly highs.",
