  "标普跌4.36%创4-5倍方差肥尾事件，VIX暴涨近70%迫使做多资金去杠杆并引发百亿对冲基金强平危机；但垃圾债未跌且逼近90/90技术反转日，美联储难再加息，正反势能均趋向均值回归。": "S&P's 4.36% drop is a 4-5 sigma fat-tail event; VIX surging ~70% forced long-market volatility sellers to deleverage and triggered margin liquidation distress at multi-billion hedge funds. Yet junk bonds held up and a 90/90 technical reversal nears while Fed rate hikes near an end, pointing to mean reversion.",
